rothschild-generated-key.hex
**/rothschild-generated-key.hex
**/*generated-key*.hex
**/*private*key*
**/*.secret

# Local node working directories — validator keys, RocksDB, logs. Never committed.
#
# This was a list of four literal names under the same comment, and three directories walked
# straight past it: `.misaka-vlt-devnet-2-expired/`, `.misaka-vlt-devnet-3/` and
# `.misaka-vlt-reorg/` were committed whole — 717 files, ~450 MB of `.sst`, `MANIFEST`, `LOCK`
# and `IDENTITY`, and **14 `validator.key` files** — into a public repository. An enumerated list
# only ignores the names somebody thought of; the next harness run picks a new suffix and is
# tracked by default. Patterns, and a rule for the key itself that does not depend on where it
# happens to sit.
.misaka-*/
.soak-*/
**/validator.key
**/*.seed

# PALW worker per-cwd GGUF sha cache (generated wherever a worker runs)
.palw-gguf-sha.json
